      "text_hash": "b8f91394c52d1a01d059b103297c0b06e603bfe9944d41b94c6ee2e45e4e2707",
      "text": "Charlie says: Differential privacy guarantees that individual sample presence is bounded."
    },
    {
      "record_id": "rec_0007",
